version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
keywords:
  - deep brain stimulation
  - local field potential
  - Medtronic Percept
  - BrainSense
  - nucleus accumbens
  - craving
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for analysing BrainSense Snapshot spectra and Timeline
  LFP recordings from Medtronic Percept devices around patient-marked events,
  with the paper's canonical-band statistics, leave-one-out frequency-band
  classifier, cluster-based permutation test and amplitude-threshold
  classifier. Includes the standalone scripts that reproduce the paper's
  statistics.
